WEBVTT

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.110
Once upon a time, in a land far far away...

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:11.440
Or rather, in a place called 
"Ishiyama High School,"

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:20.370
there was a barbaric, ruthless, and defiant 
bastard who thought nothing of his fellow man.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.740
So you're the first year, Oga?

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.050
I'm Abe, a second year!

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.380
Fight me!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:36.010
Second year Abe and the first 
year punk Oga are gonna fight!

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:40.350
Shut up. You're gonna wake the baby, baldy.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.500
Now he's said it!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.230
Damn, does he know what this guy is called?

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.600
He's Abe the killing machine!

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:50.980
Killer?! Scary!

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:56.930
But Oga is the legendary Rampaging 
Demon Ogre of Kata Jr. High!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.490
Demon? That's one seriously bad dude.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.830
This guy rains blood!

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.370
Hey, look at Oga!

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.840
Oga's turning chicken?

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:13.260
He's on top... It's coming out... 
He's on top and lettin' it go...

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.240
Damn that's a lot of sweat.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.890
I guess Oga isn't a match 
for Abe the killing machine.

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.710
Wait, that's not sweat!

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.020
On his head!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.440
There's a baby pissing on his head!

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.440
Whatever!

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.900
Fight me!

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.780
Does my head look like a 
urinal to you, you brat?

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:38.000
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.930
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:44.660
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:48.570
What the hell is that look for?

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.340
Who's the damn kid?

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:02.000
<b>I Picked up the Demon Lord</b>

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.720
Once upon a time, in a land far away,

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:12.510
there was a handsome, cool, and popular 
young man whom everyone looked up to.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.260
Screw you, Oga!

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.510
Die!

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.430
The kind hearted young man said this:

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.020
Everyone grovel before me!

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.290
Hold it, hold it...

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:22.870
Hmm?

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.620
Don't "hmm" me!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.740
Who's kind hearted and popular again?

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.550
And what the hell is with the baby, huh?

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:35.530
Silly little Furuichi, that's what 
I was getting around to telling you.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.180
Break my train of thought, 
and I break your back!

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:40.910
Now listen up!

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:43.870
We apologize for rising 
above our station just now.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:48.590
You were just sleeping there so helplessly, 
Oga-kun, that we thought it was our chance...

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:50.120
It wasn't a chance.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.890
You know, if I were anybody 
but me, I'd be dead.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.240
Yeah, for real...

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.150
Sure wish you were dead...

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.850
The kind hearted young man...

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.370
...went to do some washing up in the river.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.390
He's a demon!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:08.270
Dang...

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.270
And then...

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.300
Floating, floating...

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.930
Floating, floating...

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:20.590
From upstream, a big guy came 
floating, floating down the river...

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.230
Okay, stop!

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:27.540
Where are you going with this story, and 
what the hell do you mean, a "big guy?"

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.020
He floated down the river! What can I say?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.420
"Big guys" don't float down rivers, damn it!

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:35.730
Well, it was definitely quite shocking.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.100
Actually, all the other dudes turned 
and ran the second they saw him.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.430
Well, duh!

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:43.260
But the kind hearted young man 
was not taken aback in fear,

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:46.290
and all by himself, lifted 
the big guy out of the river!

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:47.320
Oh!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.400
And then split him in half.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.160
From inside, a spirited baby boy...

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.330
You <i>split</i> him?!

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.040
You <i>split</i> him?!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.780
The young man said,

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.290
"Oh, what a cute baby!"

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.520
But, what the hell?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.380
Crap, what am I supposed to do?

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:21.500
Precious...

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.030
Farewell!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.900
Transfer!

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:43.080
The kind hearted young man stayed calm and 
responded to the situation like an adult.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.280
So kid...

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.700
Are you <i>lost</i>?

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.610
Wait, I'm doing it wrong...

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:51.710
Maybe, more light hearted?

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:54.100
There-there-there-there!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.140
No, that's not...

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.470
Hey brat! I'll steal your very soul!

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:02.100
After that, the baby...

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.320
...got totally attached to me.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:10.650
Or so it seems.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:13.950
Enough already! Who the hell 
would believe that story?

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:17.050
Take him back to wherever 
you got him from already!

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:17.820
You idiot!

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.330
Wait, kid!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.270
Look at this!

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:23.640
See? It's a camel cricket!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.110
What the hell are you doing?

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.250
This totally worked before, idiot!

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.210
Crap, he's bored with it.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.930
I guess you rank lower than 
a camel cricket, Furuichi.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.540
This is what happens when he cries.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.710
That's why you can't just 
pull him away like that.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.060
Yeah, don't you think there's 
something <i>wrong</i> with that?

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:48.770
Furuichi, you idiot!

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:50.220
Keep your voice down!

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.770
Let's take this out back, asshole!

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.450
Say what?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.840
You're going to make him cry again!

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:14.130
Anyway, all we can do for 
now is keep him distracted.

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.240
"We" my ass!

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:18.760
Don't go mixing me up in this!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.590
Whatever, just hurry up and search!

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:23.390
Find something that can 
grab this brat's heart!

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.330
As if!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:30.890
This is Ishiyama High, the worst school in the 
entire country! We're 120% Grade A delinquents!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:38.180
Ishiyama High! 120% JDs, 
the worst in the country!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:40.380
What's wrong?

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.650
Oga brought a baby with 'im!

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.200
A baby?!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:49.080
Idiot! Do something, Furuichi!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.370
Think, me! Think!

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.790
Bingo!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.130
It's Count Poo, who appears 
in the anime "Gohan-kun!"

00:08:59.130 --> 00:08:59.840
Take a look!

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.200
Furuichi!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:06.140
Then I've got no choice!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.010
Nice, Furuichi!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:11.910
And why do you have that with you?

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:15.180
I was thinking of giving it to the girl who 
works at the convenience store as a present.

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.480
Furuichi, you sicken me.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.570
Screw you!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.600
What the hell is that kid?

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.300
Oga's kid?

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.860
Wait, that's no human.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.720
What the hell are you lookin' at?

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.940
My body can't take much more of this.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.400
There's only one thing left to do.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:46.220
Put him to sleep and stick him back 
inside the big guy before he wakes up!

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:48.460
The big guy's still split open?

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:51.100
I mean, I don't think we can just ditch 'im.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.230
Furuichi, you idiot!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:54.850
Do I look like such a cruel person?

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:02.480
<b>School Store</b>

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.480
All sold out!

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:03.750
Then an anpan?

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:04.950
Sold out!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.480
Fruit milk?

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:07.820
Sold out.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.600
Curry rice?

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:10.330
Yup, sold out.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.120
Then whaddya got left, damn it?

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:32.700
Pardon me.

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:34.270
What are you planning on doing?

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.020
Furuichi, you're such an idiot.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:41.520
It's only natural to get sleepy 
after you fill up your belly!

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.250
Just watch me! I'm gonna feed him plenty!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:44.940
He's gone!

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.030
Over there!

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:47.550
The yakisoba bread is mine!

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:49.860
That bread is mine! I'll stake my life on it!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.680
Yakisoba bread!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.380
It's mine!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:03.800
Wait for me!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:07.650
Yakisoba bread, wait!

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.810
Hey, Oga...

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.950
Do you think the baby is... happy?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.870
What the hell is this baby?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.560
It is time.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:41.410
He is near.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.470
Leave no stone unturned.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:57.920
Listen up, Furuichi...

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.140
This might be to our benefit.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.590
Wait, why are we at <i>my</i> house?

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:06.600
Once upon a time, there was 
a fine young lumberjack.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.340
Hold it!

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:09.040
That joke is old now!

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:14.090
The young man threw his ax into the lake, and 
the spirit of the lake appeared and said,

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:16.080
"Was it this old ax you threw in the lake?

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.610
Or was it this golden baby?"

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:19.920
Yeah, I saw that one a mile away.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.200
Here! Have a golden baby!

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.290
I ain't taking that thing!

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:27.120
Not some freaky baby!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.620
I've got a date I'm going on tonight!

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.330
Then, perfect!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:35.940
You and that girl can raise him 
and live happily ever after!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.770
Let go of me, you!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:39.420
Listen up, baby!

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:41.760
If you seriously make me mad...

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:44.070
I'll show you the pits of hell!

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:52.930
Furuichi.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:53.440
Yeah.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.060
He's totally attached to me.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.310
Attached to you?

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.860
You're delusional.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:07.100
The Master would never 
take to the likes of you!

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:09.130
Die, gutter-trash!

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:13.850
W-Who might you be?

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.330
Who you callin' gutter-trash?

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:16.760
And get down from there, now!

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:18.430
Waltzing into my house like you own it!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:19.630
Uh, it's <i>my</i> house.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:22.470
Why are you pickin' a fight like always, Oga?

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:24.090
She ain't normal, dude!

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.600
Now, Master, come here.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.700
Hilda is here to bring you home.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:34.020
Bring home?

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:38.050
Looks like he doesn't like you!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:38.980
Freaky...

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.300
Come now, Master...

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.950
It is time to go!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:48.410
Let go of <i>him</i>, Master!

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.900
Oh, my! What am I to do?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.150
Oga, maybe I'm missing something here...

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:56.070
But if you give the baby back to 
her, won't that fix everything?

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.240
She came to pick you up, you brat!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.830
Furuichi, you idiot, help!

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.150
I apologize.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:21.730
I am the demon Hildegarde, and I 
am this baby's maidservant demon.

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:22.870
Demon?

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:27.380
And that child is to be 
the king of we demons.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.670
His name is...

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:31.660
Kaiser de Emperana Beelzebub IV.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.950
In other words, he is the Demon Lord.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:41.170
Demon Lord?

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:44.920
You foolish humans, I will destroy you!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.040
Demon Lord?

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:48.470
Demon Lord!?

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:54.400
Son of mine, destroy humanity!

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.890
Um, Hilda-san, was it?

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:01.480
Thanks for the exposition! 
That's great and all...

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:05.030
But since you've come to take him 
back, well, if you don't mind...

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.160
No, that won't be possible.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:11.200
Why? Because you seem to have been chosen.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.460
As the Demon Lord's father!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:17.830
The Great Demon Lord said this:

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:23.340
I'll get to destroying humanity tomorrow.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:28.010
They're like, so annoying. 
They breed like roaches.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.090
Why don't we just, like, 
totally wipe them out?

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:34.470
But Great Demon Lord, tomorrow is 
the Dark Dragon King's wedding.

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.520
Really?

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:36.910
Then, the day after tomorrow.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:37.850
I'll definitely get to it 
the day after tomorrow.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:42.350
The day after is the hell-wide 
chupacabra hunting bus tour.

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.240
Well, dang! I'm like, so super busy!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.610
And after that, the 10,000-day 
mahjong marathon on Demon Isle.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.540
Oh, forget it.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.590
I'll have that kid I just had do it.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:53.980
Hilda!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:54.780
Yes?

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:57.950
Take him to the human world, 
find some human to raise him,

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:01.350
and have him destroy humanity, 'kay?

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:04.180
...is what he said.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.420
The Great Demon Lord...

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.640
Seems like he's got a screw loose.

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:10.860
I have come here in search of a human 
suitable to be the young Master's parent.

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:14.070
Good luck!

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.930
You just gonna run away?

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.940
This is <i>my</i> house! Go home!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:19.910
Hell no!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.900
I knew it! My eyes do not lie!

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:24.800
Who?!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:27.020
This is the dimensional 
transference demon, Alaindelon.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.970
A dimensional transference 
demon is just as the name says:

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:33.280
A demon that can transfer people 
or things between the dimensions!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.970
Transfer!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:38.730
Ow!

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:43.540
In order to transfer the Master from the 
Demon World, I floated down the river.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:50.390
And, half conscious, I saw you standing and 
laughing heartily as humans groveled before you!

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:52.050
I was convinced!

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:56.530
Ah! I can leave the Master 
in this person's hands!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.100
So <i>that's</i> why!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:16:59.540
It was your destiny.

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:01.210
You've got to be kidding me!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.810
The parent of the Demon Lord?

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:05.600
So the kid likes me a 
little! Big effin' deal!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.690
I ain't gonna to do it! No way!

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.810
In other words, you refuse?

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.120
Duh!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.680
Take him and leave, now!

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:14.420
Is that so?

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:16.250
Then, please die.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.500
Crap! She's actually a demon?

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.770
Wait, Oga!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.500
You are <i>so</i> paying for repairs!

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.760
Yes you are, damn it!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.570
What's this? This is a real laugh!

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:38.760
Don't crack on me, Furuichi!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.350
I can handle this!

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.510
Hell no you can't!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.130
He's still stuck on your back!

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:44.700
What? You damn...

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.080
He won't come off!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.370
Give up!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:50.110
Did you think you could escape a demon?

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:51.540
Shut it!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.330
Just stay up there forever 
trying to look cool!

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:54.490
Akubaba!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.580
Yup, she's a demon!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.650
Oga kick!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.000
You. Kicked. A. Demon!?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.110
Okay, I kind of respect that about you!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.220
It's important to hit 'em first!

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.620
Isn't that the Rampaging Ogre?

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.230
Looks like something's going down.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:38.240
Hey, it's "Demon..." Runnin' from a woman?

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:40.230
This is seriously our chance!

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:42.700
Okay, we're gonna help that broad!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:47.940
You think you can escape?

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:52.590
You refuse, despite being 
chosen by the Demon Lord.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:55.800
Demons are <i>very</i> picky 
about contracts, you see.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.550
Die.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:05.570
Master?

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.690
Oga!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.810
What is this? He's freakin' out?

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.660
Is this the power of a demon?

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.340
M-Master!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.840
Please do not throw a tantrum!

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:37.740
Tantrum?! This is way beyond a tantrum!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:38.970
Where's Oga?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.360
He's unconscious!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.470
Or worst-case dead?!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.500
Can't you do something?

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.500
This is seriously not going to end well!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.680
I cannot.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:52.230
When he gets like that, there 
is no stopping the Master.

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:53.830
You can't?

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.490
Then what are we supposed to do?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:58.110
I told you there's nothing to be done!

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:02.090
Only the Great Demon Lord could 
calm a crying fit such as this...

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.650
A man shouldn't go crying like that.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.560
People'll think you're weak.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:28.620
He stopped!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.090
That's... impossible!

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.160
Even I couldn't stop him 
when he cries like that...

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.440
And yet, with not so much as a...

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:41.880
Good!

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.540
Now, no more crying.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:44.980
Bingo.

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:47.200
And don't follow me anymore.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.920
Master!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.120
What the hell am I doing?

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.740
He destroyed the steel tower!

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:34.290
I can't believe he resonated with the 
Master and pulled out so much power!

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.950
What the... Who in the world is he?

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:41.490
Oga!

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.170
Ah, man... A dream sequence?

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.970
That was the stupidest dream ever.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:54.600
Phew... With that setup, I was totally 
gonna end up the parent of the Demon Lord!

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:57.080
Finally awake, are we?

00:21:58.360 --> 00:22:02.060
It has been a full two days, 
and I am tired of waiting.

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:03.420
Why are you here?

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:04.840
And wait, you were here the whole time?

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.470
What are you so surprised about?

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:13.840
Starting from today, let us raise a 
fine Demon Lord to destroy humanity.

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:02.980
And there you have it.

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:06.250
The handsome, cool, popular, 
and kind hearted young man

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:09.370
defeated the Demon Lord, and they 
all lived happily ever after!

00:24:09.370 --> 00:24:09.990
Yes, happily...

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:11.160
Hold it a second!

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:11.970
You didn't defeat him!

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:12.700
Nobody ended up happy!

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:14.240
And it's only the first episode!

00:24:14.240 --> 00:24:15.510
Shut it, Furuichi!

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:16.890
I am not raising him, no way!

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:18.750
He's a baby Demon Lord, damn it!

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:20.390
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:22.720
Say Hi to the BoB Brawler

00:24:22.720 --> 00:24:24.700
Don't go doing previews on your own!
